# .publishing_protocol — per-repo publishing config, read by nao-aur-publish
# and by agents before any release work. Generic rules: PUBLISHING_PROTOCOL.md
# in the nao-aur-publish repo.
PUBLISH_BRANCH=supermaster
PKGBUILD_PATH=aur/PKGBUILD
AUR_PACKAGE=freeclaw
VERSION_FILE=package.json
# NOTES:
# - supermaster ONLY. master is a stale fork branch; main is upstream
#   OpenClaw — ignore both entirely.
# - package.json version must align with pkgver (e.g. 9.0.0 <-> 9).
# - AUR is published ONLY via: nao-aur-publish freeclaw vN
#   Never push this repo's git history to AUR.
# - .SRCINFO is never committed here — generated at publish time.
